# Scribe worker endpoint capability — gates POST /join|/status|/stop on the
# worker. Loaded ONLY by the `app` (harness monitor) and `scribe` services
# (compose env_file). Copy to .env.scribe (gitignored) and fill in. At least 32
# bytes:
#
#   openssl rand -hex 32
#
# It can start/stop captures of meetings that pass host validation; it cannot
# write transcripts. Never put it in .env.secrets (that file is shared by
# services that must not hold it).
RELAY_SCRIBE_WORKER_CAPABILITY=
